# Local device notes, browser state, screenshots, and test output.
/.local/
/AGENTS.md
**/VALIDATION.md
**/.playwright-cli/
**/output/
**/preview.png
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Runtime data and credentials must stay outside source and releases.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
keys.json
settings.json
devices.json
